title: FamA
when: $day == 1 && $package == "backpack" && $packageState == "Broken" || $packageState == "Flattened"
color: purple
group: FamA && Day1
position: -1643,-650
---
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
<<once>>
Mailman: Good afternoon! Are you Lina?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SpeakingTired">>
Lina: That's me. Sofie, your package is here!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: Perfect! Just need your signature right here.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SpeakingTired">>
Lina: Of course. I haven't seen you before, are you new?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: Yeah, just started this week. Still figuring out the routes. You'll have to be patient with the new guy, haha.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Well... I hope delivering ruined packages doesn't become a habit.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Oh no... is it that bad?
Lina: It's completely crushed! What happened?
Mailman: I'm really sorry, it must've been damaged on the way here. I take full responsibility.
Lina: This is unacceptable. I'll have to report it.
Mailman: I understand. Please, let me make it right next time. I promise I'll be more careful.
Lina: Let's hope so. Good evening.
Mailman: You too, ma'am.
<<hideCharacter "Lina">>
<<else>>
...
<<endonce>>
<<hideBackground>>

===

title: FamA
